msgstr "Ei tuloksia ¯\\_(°╭╮°)_/¯"

msgid ""
"No secret service found. Rufin will use a file to store its credentials. "
"Cancelling will not save credentials at all."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Only downloads from this rule will be deleted. Shared and manual downloads "
